{"id":"escena","lemma":"escena","pos":"noun","rank":687,"glosses":["scene","stage","cutscene"],"ipa":"/esˈθena/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"escenas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-escena.wav","examples":[{"text":"No hagas una escena.","en":"Don't make a scene.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586011"},{"text":"Esta escena me encanta.","en":"This scene delights me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639917"},{"text":"Fue una escena horrorosa.","en":"It was a horrible scene.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594636"},{"text":"Eso fue una impactante escena.","en":"That was a sight for sore eyes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803923"},{"text":"La policía acordonó la escena del crimen.","en":"Police cordoned off the crime scene.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687286"}]}